lete and all tests pass — guides the clean exit from a development branch with structured options for merge, PR, or cleanup","headings":["The Exit Strategy: Finishing a Development Branch","Overview","The Process","Step 1: Verify Tests","Run project's test suite","Step 2: Determine Base Branch","Try common base branches","Step 3: Present Options","Step 4: Execute Choice","Switch to base branch","Pull latest","Merge feature branch","Verify tests on merged result","If tests pass","Push branch","Create PR","Summary","Test Plan"],"name_hint":"exit · strategy","description_zh":"在实现完成且测试通过后，按合并、PR 或清理选项结束开发分支。"},{"path":"skills/interrogation-debugging/SKILL.md","name":"interrogation-debugging","description":"Use when encountering any bug, test failure, or unexpected behavior — finds the rat in the code through systematic root-cause interrogation before any fix attempts","headings":["The Interrogation: Systematic Debugging","Overview","The Iron Law","When to Use","The Four Phases","The Brief","Cross-Examination","The Theory","The Hit","Red Flags — STOP and Follow Process","The Don's Signals You're Doing It Wrong","Common Rationalizations","Quick Reference","When Investigation Reveals No Root Cause","Related Skills","Omerta Compliance"],"name_hint":"interrogation · debugging","description_zh":"遇到缺陷、测试失败或异常时，先系统调查根因再尝试修复。"},{"path":"skills/laundering/SKILL.md","name":"laundering","description":"Use when all territories report completion after the hit — handles integration, verification, consigliere final review, cleanup, and ledger updates to produce clean production-ready code","headings":["Laundering: Verification and Integration","Overview","Trigger","Process","Step 1: Integration","If using worktrees per territory","Step 2: Verification","Run all tests","Run linter","Run type checker (if applicable)","Step 3: Technical Debt Audit","Technical Debt Audit","Documented Exceptions","Step 4: Consigliere Final Review","Step 5: Automated Cleanup","Step 6: Evidence Disposal","Ste