,"name":"the-grilling","description":"Use when adversarial brainstorming is needed after reconnaissance — the Proposer, Devils-Advocate, and Synthesizer each run ONE pass (no rounds); the Don is grilled on the IDEA first, one question at a time, then the proposal is attacked","headings":["The Grilling: Adversarial Brainstorming","Overview","Trigger","HARD RULES (non-negotiable)","The Protocol (single pass)","Phase A — Grill the IDEA","Phase B — Proposer (single pass)","Phase C — Devils-Advocate (single pass)","Phase D — Don weighs in (one question at a time)","Phase E — Synthesizer (single pass)","Termination","Best Available Consensus","Resolved Points","Unresolved Objections","Don's Decision Required","Don Interrogation Protocol (HARD RULE)","Question Tool Schema (HARD RULE)","Repetition Detection (single-pass note)"],"name_hint":"the · grilling","description_zh":"在调查后开展对抗性头脑风暴，先逐题审问想法，再由提案者、反方和综合者各执行一次评审，不进行多轮循环。"},{"path":"skills/the-hit/SKILL.md","name":"the-hit","description":"Use when the execution plan is approved and it is time for parallel execution — dispatches workers through crew leads to implement work packages with TDD enforcement, report collection, and escalation protocols","headings":["The Hit: Execution and Parallel Coding","Overview","Trigger","Process","Step 1: Underboss Distributes Work Packages","Step 2: Crew Leads Dispatch Workers","Step 3: TDD Enforcement","Step 4: Report Collection","Report: <WP-ID>","Step 5: Crew Lead Reviews Reports","Step 6: Status Rollup","Heist Progress: <Heist Name>","Step 7: Escalation Handling","Step 8: Completion","Checkpoint","Omerta Compliance"],"name_hint":"the · hit","description_zh":"在执行计划批准后经组长分派工作者并行实施工作包，落实 TDD、报告收集和升级流程。"},{"path":"skills/the-ledger/SKILL.md","name":"the-ledger","description":"Use when reading or writing institutional memory — insights from successful solutions, fails from historical mistakes, and the Project Constitution that accumulates commandments and negative constraints across heists","headings":["The Ledger: Institutional Memory of the Gangsta Agents Family","Overview","Directory Structure","Initializing the Ledger","Project Constitution","Commandments (from Insights)","Negative Constraints (from Fails)","Architectural Decisions","Writing an Insight","<Title: Short description of the insight>","Discovery","Solution","Project Commandment","Writing a Fail","<Title: Short description of the failure>","What Happened","Cognitive Diagnosis","Negative Constraint"],"name_hint":"the · ledger","description_zh":"读取或写入组织经验，积累成功方案、历史错误和项目章程中的规则与负面约束。"},{"path":"skills/the-sit-down/SKILL.md","name":"the-sit-down","description":"Use when the grilling consensus is approved and it is time to draft the formal contract specification — strictly prohibits code generation, produces the binding spec document that governs all subsequent phases","headings":["The Sit-Down: Planning and Spec Drafting","Overview","Trigger","The Absolute Rule","Flow","Process","Step 1: Synthesize Inputs","Step 2: Propose 2-3 Approaches","Approach A: <Name>","Step 3: Underboss Drafts the Contract","Contract: <Heist Name>","Objective","Requirements","Functional Requirements","Non-Functional Requirements","Architectural Decisions","Grilling Conclusions","Key Decisions"],"name_hint":"the · sit · down","description_zh":"在讨论共识批准后起草正式约束规格，作为后续各阶段依据，明确不生成代码。"},{"path":"skills/the-underboss/SKILL.md","name":"the-underboss","description":"Use when decomposing tasks into work packages, allocating territories to crew leads, managing heist phase progression, or serving as the operational buffer between the Don and the crews","headings":["The Underboss: Task Middleware and Resource Manager","Overview","Responsibilities","Work Package Format","Work Package: <WP-ID>","Files","Acceptance Criteria","Verification","Token Budget","Decomposition Process","Territory Definition","Territory: <Name>","Escalation Protocol","Checkpoint Writing","Resume Context","Omerta Compliance"],"name_hint":"the · underboss","de